# 2026-07-23 23:05:45.736989
+The tests fail because server2.py uses COMPANY_INFO_DATE = date.min, and Cassandra rejects it:
+
+Unable to coerce '1-01-01' to a formatted date (long)
+
+Only edit server2.py. Do not edit server1.py or rest_test.py.
+
+Fix this by using a valid sentinel date object that Cassandra accepts, such as date(1970, 1, 1), instead of date.min.
+
+Make sure all queries that filter out the sentinel row still work:
+- date > COMPANY_INFO_DATE
+- date >= start_date AND date <= end_date
+
+After editing, suggest only these commands:
+docker compose up --build -d -t 0 --no-deps server2
+docker exec p6-server2-1 python3 -m pytest rest_test.py -v

